package: @astryxdesign/cli

## Wrap your app in a theme

Install a theme, import it with the CLI, and wire the generated module once. For the full guide — available themes, integration themes, dark mode, nested themes, and production builds — see `npx @astryxdesign/cli@0.7.12 docs use-a-theme`.

Wire the generated module once:
```tsx
import {Theme} from '@astryxdesign/core/theme';
import {themes, defaultThemeSlug} from './astryx-themes';

function App() {
  return (
    <Theme theme={themes[defaultThemeSlug]}>
      <YourApp />
    </Theme>
  );
}
```

